stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Busy : start
  Busy --> Idle : stop
  Busy --> Check
  state Check <<choice>>
  Check --> Fast : small
  Check --> Slow : large
  Check --> Fail : bad
  Fast --> [*]
  Slow --> [*]
  state Fork <<fork>>
  Fail --> Fork
  Fork --> R1
  Fork --> R2
  state Join <<join>>
  R1 --> Join
  R2 --> Join
  Join --> Idle
  note right of Busy : working hard
